From: gokwok <531504879@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 12:19:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] vmm: Advertise and own generic/profile prewarm preparation lifecycle

Keep structured v2 capabilities, idempotent retries, generic-to-profile upgrades and VM-owned cleanup independent of template preparation. Template prewarm uses upstream paused restore and resume without a custom API.

Assisted-by: Codex:GPT-6
Signed-off-by: gokwok <531504879@qq.com>
